{"version":1,"id":"roddy-ricch-die-young","title":"Die Young","artist":"Roddy Ricch","key":"G","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/roddy-ricch/die-young/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: London Tyler Holmes, Rex Kudo and Roddy Ricch","chords":[{"symbol":"G","canonical":"G","keyboardPitchClasses":[7,11,2],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"D","canonical":"D","keyboardPitchClasses":[2,6,9],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Em","canonical":"Em","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,7,11],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"C","canonical":"C","keyboardPitchClasses":[0,4,7],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"I ain't tryna die young, so I gotta ride with one","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":19,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":52,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"Stood ten toes down in my Balenziaga, ayy","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":17,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":37,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"He ran down on a nigga, that’s a shotta, shotta","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":19,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":44,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"Cold hearted nigga, wet tha blocka, blocka","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":39,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"Gotta keep it on me, I don't wanna die young","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":13,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":41,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"I rather be judged by twelve, than carried by six","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":14,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":38,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"How am I gon' post bail? Just look at my wrist","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":16,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":44,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"Tell me, why the legends always gotta die quick?","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":19,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":41,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"section","text":"[Verse 1]","columns":9,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"When I'm in traffic gotta slide with the beam on me","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":16,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":43,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"'Cause I keep 'bout ten racks bussin' out the jeans on me","columns":57,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":15,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":49,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"Niggas be hatin', I'm rich, it's all about the cream, homie","columns":59,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":16,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":51,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"If I ever get caught lackin', they gon' slide","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":45,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"Ever since I got the Rollie, I ain't got the time","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":14,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":48,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"Flawless diamonds, niggas can't never block the shine","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":49,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"They know I'm ballin' in the city like DeRozan","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":16,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":42,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"Gotta keep my niggas 'round me, I can't do the wrong friends","columns":60,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":17,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":49,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"I was knockin' down walls, now they closin' in","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":10,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":38,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"Hopped off the porch, and then I hopped inside the Porsche, ayy","columns":63,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":18,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":54,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"Fuck being the side nigga, I'ma be the main course","columns":50,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":17,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":40,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"Whipped the Rolls like a young nigga made for it","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":15,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":38,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"section","text":"[Chorus]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"I ain't tryna die young, so I gotta ride with one","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":21,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":52,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"Stood ten toes down in my Balenciaga, ayy","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":17,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":37,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"He ran down on a nigga, that’s a shotta, shotta","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":19,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":44,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"Cold hearted nigga wet that blocka, blocka","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":13,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":37,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"Gotta keep it on me, I don't wanna die young","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":42,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"I rather be judged by twelve, than carried by six","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":15,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":38,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"How am I gon' post bail? Just look at my wrist","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":16,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":43,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"Tell me, why the legends always gotta die quick?","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":20,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":39,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"section","text":"[Verse 2]","columns":9,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"Tryna get my bag, I had to go and make it happen","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":45,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"lyric","text":"Me and my dogs, we was bussin' out them bandos","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":42,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-34","kind":"lyric","text":"Count out them hunnids, then we throw it in the mattress","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":18,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":51,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-35","kind":"lyric","text":"Wrap it in plastic, and throw it in the attic","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":14,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":44,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-36","kind":"lyric","text":"I be in the streets, nigga, I stand ten toes","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":16,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":37,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-37","kind":"lyric","text":"Any nigga in my situation would've been fold","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":36,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-38","kind":"lyric","text":"We was trappin' out the basement, made it back tenfold","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":10,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":51,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-39","kind":"lyric","text":"Gotta stay out the way, that's why I'm always on the tinfoil","columns":60,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":21,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":54,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-40","kind":"lyric","text":"We was fightin' fed cases, 'member I was 2 and 0","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":10,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":42,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-41","kind":"lyric","text":"Nigga was fightin' depression, sippin' syrup, I was movin' slow","columns":63,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":24,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":55,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-42","kind":"lyric","text":"I was down below, but still, I always kept my head up","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":49,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-43","kind":"lyric","text":"Nigga gotta get my bread up, I don't wanna die young","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":22,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":45,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-44","kind":"section","text":"[Chorus]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-45","kind":"lyric","text":"I ain't tryna die young, so I gotta ride with one","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":19,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":51,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-46","kind":"lyric","text":"Stood ten toes down in my Balenziaga Ayy","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":17,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":36,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-47","kind":"lyric","text":"He ran down on a nigga, that’s a shotta, shotta","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":19,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":43,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-48","kind":"lyric","text":"Cold hearted nigga wet that blocka, blocka","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":10,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":39,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-49","kind":"lyric","text":"Gotta keep it on me, I don't wanna die young","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":43,"beat":2}]},{"id":